{"step_index":1987,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-10-26T13:52:24Z","input_tokens":2300,"cache_read_tokens":38310,"output_tokens":1569,"content":"### Architectural Plan: Partitioning and Filtering by Subsidiary\n\nStr